    "details": {
      "isComplex": true,
      "level": {
        "value": 3
      },
      "disable": "<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\">@Check[type:diplomacy|dc:22|name:To convince the Spirit Everything is Okay|traits:complex,haunt,hazard] (trained)</span><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\">To convince the Spirit Everything is Okay</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\">@Check[type:religion|dc:18|name:To Quiet the Spirit|traits:complex,haunt,hazard] (expert)</span><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\">To Quiet the Spirit</span></li>\n</ul>",
      "description": "<p>On the floor, the dust is disturbed, almost as if an invisible person was pacing back and forth before the fireplace... With a sudden flash, your mind is filled with a woman's memory, overcome by worry about what her husband might be doing during his late nights spent in the basement. </p>\n<p><strong>Universal Haunt</strong>: This affects every Creature that triggers it.</p>",
      "reset": "<p>This Haunt automatially resets after one day until the supernatural Fungus in B37 is dealt with, even if the haunt was previously disabled.</p>",
      "routine": "<p><strong>Trigger: </strong>Creature enters its pacing path.</p>\n<p><strong style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\">Lorey We're Leaving: </strong>Casts 4th-level Suggestion on triggering creature ( @Check[type:will|dc:19|name:Suggestion|traits:mental,incapacitating,linguistic,necromancy,occult] save to avoid effect), causing the creature to grab an ally, believing that ally to be their child and drag them out of the room, likely into the path of other hazards.</p>\n<hr style=\"border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-light-primary); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-light-highlight);\" />\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Critical Success</strong>&nbsp;The target is unaffected and knows you tried to control it.</li>\n<li><strong>Success</strong>&nbsp;The target is unaffected and thinks you were talking to them normally, not casting a spell on them.</li>\n<li><strong>Failure</strong>&nbsp;The target immediately follows your suggestion. The spell has a duration of 1 minute, or until the target has completed a finite suggestion or the suggestion becomes self-destructive or has other obvious negative effects.</li>\n<li><strong>Critical Failure</strong>&nbsp;As failure, but the base duration is 1 hour.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
